dialogue boss_intro_greenvalley
title: The Captain's Field
trigger: StageStart greenvalley-03
speaker boss moorcaptain
speaker commander $commander

node a boss
  So you're the ones who broke my Collector's plate and drove off in my tithe wagon. Tithe paid its colour every month without a word until you came.
  -> b

node b commander
  Tithe paid because your man stood on the bridge with a prisoner. You sold the holds' tithe to the Choir. Your own people's.
  -> c

node c boss
  I sold it at quota. Without me the Choir takes three times that and nobody keeps the count. Give me room on my own moor and I strike twice.
  -> d

node d commander
  Then no room. Stay close to him, everyone. Never let the Captain end a turn alone.
